			"notes": "- The NeoForge and Fabric downloads now have different file names, ending in `-neoforge` or `-fabric`, so it's easy to tell which one you have\n- No gameplay changes, so your worlds and settings carry over as they are\n\n## 1.0.0\n\nThe first release, combining Elytra Slot and Charm of Undying into one mod for Accessories.\n\n- Wear an elytra in the cape slot and fly with a chestplate on. It wears down and hides your cape just like it would in the chest slot, and shows your own elytra or cape texture\n- Wear a Totem of Undying in the charm slot and it saves you without being held. The full totem animation still plays for you and everyone nearby\n- The totem shows on your chest, and you can hide it or move it in the config file\n- Works with elytras and totems from many other mods, like Deeper Darker, Mekanism, Lil' Wings, Biome Makeover and Friends & Foes\n- On NeoForge, you don't need Caelus. Accessories is the only extra mod required\n- Available for NeoForge and Fabric on Minecraft 1.21.1"
		}
